  "description": "The meme is designed to target individuals who hold or are susceptible to antisemitic conspiracy theories, particularly those who believe in the 'Jewish-American conspiracy' myth. The intended audience likely includes people who are exposed to or propagate hateful stereotypes against Jewish people and Americans, and who may be influenced by or seek to reinforce prejudiced views about these communities. The visual and textual elements are crafted to appeal to those who interpret the image as evidence of a supposed Jewish-American global dominance, thereby inciting hostility toward both groups.",
